{"meta":{"title":"Volunteers | Shelter of Hope","description":"Join Shelter of Hope's volunteer network to stand beside people in your community."},"header":{"title":"Volunteer","subtitle":"Join Shelter of Hope's volunteer network to stand beside people in your community.","breadcrumbHome":"Home","breadcrumbCurrent":"Become a Volunteer"},"intro":{"badgeTitle":"Volunteer","welcomeTitle":"Welcome — to the journey of standing beside ","welcomeHighlight":"Shelter of Hope","welcomeSuffix":"","p1":"You may not know how important even an hour of your time could be for someone in need.","p2":"When a child goes missing, when a woman faces insecurity, or when a family suddenly encounters crisis—what they need most is compassionate individuals who won't just hear the news, but will actively step forward to help.","p3":"Shelter of Hope's Volunteer Community is for those people who believe—","quote":"“I alone cannot change everything, but I can be part of the change.”","p4":"Your time, your skills, your network, or your small initiative—anything can become a vital lifeline at a critical moment.","invitation":"So today, we invite you—","invitationText":"Not just to join us, but to take personal ownership of standing by people."},"whyJoin":{"title":"Why Become a Volunteer with Shelter of Hope?","subtitle":"Your volunteer work will not only help others, but will also nurture you into a more skilled and empathetic person.","benefits":[{"title":"Opportunity to Stand Beside People","description":"Serve women, children, and vulnerable families during critical emergencies."},{"title":"Gain Real-World Experience","description":"Gain firsthand experience addressing social issues across real-life situations."},{"title":"Leadership & Teamwork","description":"Build leadership and team management capabilities by collaborating with diverse groups."},{"title":"Recognition & Certification","description":"Earn formal recognition and certificates for your dedicated contributions."},{"title":"Build a Humanitarian Network","description":"Connect with like-minded changemakers to build an empowered volunteer community."}]},"skills":{"title":"Skills You Will Develop Working Here","subtitle":"Every task as a volunteer is an opportunity to learn something new.","items":[{"title":"Leadership & Teamwork","description":"Practical experience collaborating in teams, taking ownership, and leading others."},{"title":"Communication","description":"Effectively connecting with communities and conveying critical information during emergencies."},{"title":"Problem Solving","description":"Identifying real-life societal bottlenecks and actively being part of the solution."},{"title":"Crisis Response","description":"Rapid decision-making in high-pressure situations and linking affected people to emergency support."},{"title":"Event & Campaign Management","description":"Hands-on participation in awareness drives, community activities, and social outreach."}]},"callout":{"title":"Your Time, Your Skills — A Ray of Hope for Someone","point1Line1":"You might not have large sums of money to give.","point1Line2":"But you have your time.","point2Line1":"You might not own a large organization.","point2Line2":"But you have your willing heart.","point3Line1":"You might not have extensive experience.","point3Line2":"But you have your humanity.","summary":"That is more than enough to start a noble deed. ❤️","description":"Any of these seemingly small efforts can become courage, relief, and hope in someone's life.","placeLead":"Then there is a welcoming place for you at ","placeHighlight":"Shelter of Hope","placeSuffix":".","facebookPageLabel":"Our Page:","facebookPageUrl":"www.facebook.com/MastulFoundation/","facebookGroupLabel":"Join our official volunteer group:","facebookGroupUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/search/top?q=shelter%20of%20hope","contactLabel":"To become a district representative & volunteer, contact our team lead: ","contactNumber":"01321146611 (Only WhatsApp)"},"form":{"title"